{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shelf Heroes is a fast-paced Roguelite FPS where rogue toys have taken over the House and only YOU can stop them! Assemble your Shelf Hero, wield wacky weapons, and blast enemies into plastic bits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into action solo or join forces with <strong>up to 3 friends</strong> in a chaotic <strong>co-op FPS adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/7b66a6b6a77c9a487164018d4deb7bf3.webp?t=1768229850\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/7b66a6b6a77c9a487164018d4deb7bf3.poster.avif?t=1768229850\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=106 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/8cf318ec051b4d98d0d2be878b0a9489.poster.avif?t=1768229850\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/8cf318ec051b4d98d0d2be878b0a9489.webm?t=1768229850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/8cf318ec051b4d98d0d2be878b0a9489.mp4?t=1768229850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KAPOW! Blast rebellious toys with an arsenal that would make any toy box jealous! A <strong>DIY shotgun</strong>? Locked and Loaded! A <strong>dinosaur-shaped revolver</strong>? You got it! A <strong>frying pan, explosive bow, or a blaster minigun</strong>\u2026 and MORE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/5c7ebfdf4178e64ac66770604ad20e2d.poster.avif?t=1768229850\" width=780 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/5c7ebfdf4178e64ac66770604ad20e2d.mp4?t=1768229850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/886c61b6a113da75aa147f37906c3fb9.poster.avif?t=1768229850\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/886c61b6a113da75aa147f37906c3fb9.webm?t=1768229850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/886c61b6a113da75aa147f37906c3fb9.mp4?t=1768229850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own route through <strong>massive open arenas</strong> of the House! Every run brings <strong>new layouts, new challenges, and new secrets</strong> to discover. Watch out for household hazards - that kiddie pool becomes an ocean when you're toy-sized! Return to your Bedroom HQ to unlock upgrades, chat with sock puppet pals, and prep for the next battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/7537afa28370d5fc8fa103a1b367aba6.poster.avif?t=1768229850\" width=780 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/7537afa28370d5fc8fa103a1b367aba6.mp4?t=1768229850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/ab8921712fccc670e18f5ca98d9992a0.avif?t=1768229850\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras_big/ab8921712fccc670e18f5ca98d9992a0.avif?t=1768229850 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each body part\u2014arm, leg, head, and torso\u2014adds <strong>unique perks</strong> to customize your playstyle every run. Combine perks with random power-ups to <strong>discover wild builds</strong> and turn your toy-sized warrior into an unstoppable force!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/d83f61b1642ff4d1618c233561b04889.poster.avif?t=1768229850\" width=780 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/d83f61b1642ff4d1618c233561b04889.webm?t=1768229850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/d83f61b1642ff4d1618c233561b04889.mp4?t=1768229850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/45a1e0e5e33fee6032810ca61b4a05e0.poster.avif?t=1768229850\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/45a1e0e5e33fee6032810ca61b4a05e0.webm?t=1768229850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/45a1e0e5e33fee6032810ca61b4a05e0.mp4?t=1768229850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against rampaging toy Sentinels, Zep Knights, Sharkars, the dreaded dino Ravager, and many other deadly toy threats! Push your skills to the limit: dodge, blast, outmaneuver enemies and take down the toughest bosses to take back the House!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3151140?t=1768229850","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3151140?t=1768229850","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/1c6759b0d7794fd2c52718715cf8cd38bc4ee71c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768229850","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/1c6759b0d7794fd2c52718715cf8cd38bc4ee71c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768229850","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shelf Heroes is a fast-paced Roguelite FPS where rogue toys have taken over the House and only YOU can stop them! Assemble your Shelf Hero, wield wacky weapons, and blast enemies into plastic bits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into action solo or join forces with <strong>up to 3 friends</strong> in a chaotic <strong>co-op FPS adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/7b66a6b6a77c9a487164018d4deb7bf3.webp?t=1768229850\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151140/extras/7b66a6b6a77c9a487164018d4deb7bf3.poster.avif?t=1768229850\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=106 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shar